---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: report
---
$ nabu status 42-empty-list-notice/1
exit 1
error: tablet "42-empty-list-notice" is not stacked: nabu/tablets/42-empty-list-notice/stack.md is missing
fix: add nabu/tablets/42-empty-list-notice/stack.md

$ nabu status a/b/c
exit 1
error: invalid target "a/b/c": expected <tablet> or <tablet>/<slice>
fix: nabu status <tablet>/<slice>

$ nabu status todo-reminders/9
exit 1
error: unknown slice "9" in tablet "todo-reminders"; existing slices: 1-reminder-schedule, 2-reminder-delivery, 3-reminder-api
fix: use todo-reminders/<N>, todo-reminders/<slice> or todo-reminders/<N>-<slice>

$ nabu status nope
exit 1
error: unknown tablet "nope"; existing tablets: 42-empty-list-notice, todo-reminders
fix: nabu new nope

$ nabu status ..
exit 1
error: unknown tablet ".."; existing tablets: 42-empty-list-notice, todo-reminders
fix: nabu new ..
